## Power Wiring

| From | To | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| Solar panel (+/-) | Solar charge controller PV input | Match polarity; MC4 or screw-terminal connectors |
| Charge controller BATT out | Battery 12V 7Ah | Controller prevents overcharge/deep discharge |
| Battery (+) | Main switch (SPST) input | Single point of total shutdown for the whole rig |
| Main switch output | 12V distribution bus | Feeds buck converter AND all 3 relay COM terminals |
| 12V bus | Buck converter IN | Buck converter set to 5V output |
| Buck converter OUT (5V) | ESP32 VIN/5V, HX711 VCC, LCD VCC, Relay module VCC, Buzzer VCC | Common 5V logic rail |
| All GNDs | Common ground point | Battery(-), buck GND, ESP32 GND, relay GND, sensor GNDs, LCD GND must all tie together |

**Safety:** fuse the 12V line right after the battery (2–3A blade fuse). Never share the 5V logic rail with the 12V actuator rail directly — only the relay coils/opto-inputs are 5V; the switched heater/fan/sealer loads stay on 12V through the relay's NO contact.

