| Signal | GPIO | Connects to | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| DHT22 #1 data | 4 | Lower chamber sensor (near trays) | 10kΩ pull-up to 3.3V if not already on the module |
| DHT22 #2 data | 5 | Upper chamber sensor (near exhaust) | Second point improves airflow-uniformity accuracy |
| HX711 DT | 21 | HX711 module | Load-cell data |
